			"notes": "Mod is now feature complete, now it's time for testing and any final bug fixes!\n\nAdds the Impenduit Pylon (and Impenduit Field)\n- Face Impenduit Pylons into each other - make sure the axes match - and right click with a Heart of the Sea to erect an Impenduit Field between them.\n- To destroy an Impenduit Field, place something inside of it or remove the Heart of the Sea by right clicking the pylon with a pickaxe\n- Impenduit Fields can be walked on with Frost Walker boots - they have ice physics!\n- Impenduit Fields treat the player as if they are standing in the rain - they also work in the nether. Go crazy lmao."
